        <activityName xml:lang="en">Maintenance, scooter</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Maintenance, scooter
The data reflects the replacement of parts for the maintenance of a scooter of c 90kg (50cc). Mainly plastic and steel parts are replaced. Battery replacement: once. Life expectancy battery: 25'000 km.;
UUID: 6bb14111-38a9-30f3-8550-efbee5943407
This data sets includes the maintenance of a scooter throughout its life cycle.
Location: Data cover maintenance in Switzerland
Technology: Maintenance of a scooter (50cc)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6bb14111-38a9-30f3-8550-efbee5943407.xml</text>
